AnimatedSvg←{
   ⍝ Animated SVG of the sky, day by day, driven by JavaScript
   ⍝ ⍺ is FPS [HIRES [SKIP]]:
   ⍝   FPS: playback frames per second
   ⍝   HIRES: 1=full-size display (default 0=half-size); as in the book,
   ⍝     it has no effect (#26)
   ⍝   SKIP: days between frames (default 1=every day, 2=every other day)
   ⍝ ⍵ is (M D Y)(M D Y) TIME LAT LONG
   ⍝ Stars are computed in JavaScript (ported sky math);
   ⍝ planet positions are computed here and embedded as JSON
    opts←,⍺
    fps hires skip←opts,(≢opts)↓0 0 1
    start end t lat long←⍵
    jd1←Jnu start
    nframes←⌈(1+(Jnu end)-jd1)÷skip
    _←⎕←'Computing ',(⍕nframes),' frames (skip ',(⍕skip),')...'
    json←AnimJson(jd1+skip×¯1+⍳nframes)AnimFrames t lat long
    _←⎕←'Building SVG...'
   ⍝ Height: map, planet table, bright star table and controls
    ty←80+2160+120+50+8+32+(11×34)+10+60
    ty←ty+50+8+32+34×⌈(+/Data.BRIGHT)÷2
    head←AnimHead 80+ty+20+80
    tables y←AnimTables 80+2160+120
    script←(fps nframes jd1 skip)AnimScript lat long t json
    svg←head,(AnimBodies ⍬),tables,(AnimControls y),script,'</svg>'
    _←⎕←'Animated SVG: ',(⍕≢svg),' characters'
    svg }
